cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "iHydro Chess"
abstract: >-
  Chess puzzles built from real grandmaster games. Each puzzle has as many moves as a real expert reply in the
  SWAT-MODFLOW Google group: the pieces that move are the cost of each move to the person who asked, White or Black
  is the knowledge level the reply needed, and a direct reply is the end of a decisive game. Solving the chess
  reveals the matching move of the expert's reply and what it teaches about modelling support.
